meta {
  name: Get Branding
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/branding
  body: none
  auth: none
}

docs {
  Instance-wide brand (#158). Anonymous: every page renders with it.

  Response:
    { colors: { cta, primary, secondary, surface, body_text, border },
      tokens: { cta, cta_hover, cta_active, cta_subtle, primary, primary_hover,
                primary_active, primary_subtle, secondary, surface, body_text,
                border, wedge_start, wedge_mid, wedge_end },
      is_default, logo: null | { url, width, height, alt },
      contrast_failures: [], updated_at }

  All colours are lowercase #rrggbb. For the default palette the tokens are
  the --brand-* values of Webapp/assets/css/govnl.css.

  Caching: no in-process cache on the API, so every replica answers with the
  latest row. ETag from updated_at, Cache-Control: no-cache; send
  If-None-Match to get 304 while nothing changed.

  Responses:
    200 OK
    304 Not Modified — If-None-Match matches the current ETag
}
